#: daemon/chargethreshold_helper_actions.actions:64
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Get current battery charge limit"
msgstr "वर्तमान बैटरी चार्ज सीमां प्राप्नुवन्तु"

#: daemon/chargethreshold_helper_actions.actions:112
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Authenticate to see the current battery charge limit."
msgstr "वर्तमान बैटरी चार्ज सीमां द्रष्टुं प्रमाणीकरणं कुर्वन्तु।"

#: daemon/chargethreshold_helper_actions.actions:161
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Set battery charge limit"
msgstr "बैटरी चार्ज सीमा निर्धारयन्तु"

#: daemon/chargethreshold_helper_actions.actions:209
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Authenticate to set the battery charge limit."
msgstr "बैटरी चार्ज सीमां निर्धारयितुं प्रमाणीकरणं कुर्वन्तु।"

#: daemon/chargethreshold_helper_actions.actions:258
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Check battery conservation mode"
msgstr "बैटरी संरक्षणविधिं पश्यन्तु"

#: daemon/chargethreshold_helper_actions.actions:303
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Authenticate to check the current state of battery conservation mode."
msgstr "बैटरी-संरक्षण-विधानस्य वर्तमान-स्थितेः जाँचार्थं प्रमाणीकरणं कुर्वन्तु ।"

#: daemon/chargethreshold_helper_actions.actions:352
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Set battery conservation mode"
msgstr "बैटरी संरक्षणविधिं सेट् कुर्वन्तु"

#: daemon/chargethreshold_helper_actions.actions:397
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Authenticate to set the battery conservation mode."
msgstr "बैटरी संरक्षणविधिं सेट् कर्तुं प्रमाणीकरणं कुर्वन्तु।"

#: daemon/controllers/backlight_helper_actions.actions:64
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Get maximum brightness value"
msgstr "अधिकतमं कान्तिमूल्यं प्राप्नुवन्तु"

#: daemon/controllers/backlight_helper_actions.actions:121
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Authenticate to see the maximum brightness level."
msgstr "अधिकतमं कान्तिस्तरं द्रष्टुं प्रमाणीकरणं कुर्वन्तु।"

#: daemon/controllers/backlight_helper_actions.actions:170
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Get brightness"
msgstr "कान्ति प्राप्त करें"

#: daemon/controllers/backlight_helper_actions.actions:228
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Authenticate to see the brightness level."
msgstr "कान्तिस्तरं द्रष्टुं प्रमाणीकरणं कुर्वन्तु।"

#: daemon/controllers/backlight_helper_actions.actions:277
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Set brightness"
msgstr "कान्तिं सेट् कुर्वन्तु"

#: daemon/controllers/backlight_helper_actions.actions:335
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Authenticate to set the brightness level."
msgstr "कान्तिस्तरं सेट् कर्तुं प्रमाणीकरणं कुर्वन्तु।"

#: daemon/controllers/backlight_helper_actions.actions:383
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Get syspath"
msgstr "सिस्पथ प्राप्त करें"

#: daemon/controllers/backlight_helper_actions.actions:438
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Authenticate to see the syspath."
msgstr "सिस्पथ् द्रष्टुं प्रमाणीकरणं कुर्वन्तु।"

#: daemon/discretegpu_helper_actions.actions:64
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Check for existence of discrete GPU"
msgstr "असततस्य GPU इत्यस्य अस्तित्वं पश्यन्तु"

#: daemon/discretegpu_helper_actions.actions:109
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Authenticate to check for the existence of a discrete GPU."
msgstr "असततस्य GPU इत्यस्य अस्तित्वं परीक्षितुं प्रमाणीकरणं कुर्वन्तु ।"

#: daemon/powerdevil.desktop.cmake:4 powerdevil.notifyrc:2
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Power Management"
msgstr "शक्ति प्रबन्धन"

#: daemon/powerdevil.desktop.cmake:67
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Battery, Display and CPU power management and notification"
msgstr "बैटरी, प्रदर्शनं तथा CPU शक्तिप्रबन्धनं सूचना च"

#: daemon/wakeupsource_helper_actions.actions:64
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Set the wakeup count"
msgstr ""

#: daemon/wakeupsource_helper_actions.actions:103
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"This allows to read wakeup count on next wakeup to identify wakeup source"
msgstr ""

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:60
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Power Management System"
msgstr "विद्युत् प्रबन्धन प्रणाली"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:120
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "चेतवानी"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:177
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Used for warning notifications"
msgstr "चेतावनीसूचनानां कृते उपयुज्यते"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:235
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Notification"
msgstr "अधिसूचना"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:294
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Used for standard notifications"
msgstr "मानकसूचनानां कृते उपयुज्यते"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:353
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Critical notification"
msgstr "समीक्षात्मक सूचना"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:411
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Notifies a critical event"
msgstr "एकं महत्त्वपूर्णं घटनां सूचयति"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:470
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Battery Low"
msgstr "बैटरी न्यूनम्"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:527
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Battery has reached low level"
msgstr "बैटरी निम्नस्तरं प्राप्तवती अस्ति"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:579
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Battery Critical"
msgstr "बैटरी क्रिटिकल्"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:636
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"Battery has reached critical level. This notification triggers a countdown "
"before doing the configured action, hence it is strongly advised to leave it "
"on."
msgstr ""
"बैटरी गम्भीरस्तरं प्राप्तवती अस्ति। एषा सूचना विन्यस्तं कार्यं कर्तुं पूर्वं उल्टागणनां प्रवर्तयति, "
"अतः तत् चालू कर्तुं दृढतया सल्लाहः दत्तः ।"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:688
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Charge Complete"
msgstr "प्रभार सम्पूर्ण"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:744
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "The battery is fully charged"
msgstr "बैटरी पूर्णतया चार्जिता अस्ति"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:806
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Peripheral Battery Low"
msgstr "परिधीय बैटरी न्यून"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:860
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "The battery in a connected device, such as mouse or keyboard, is low"
msgstr "मूषकस्य कीबोर्डस्य वा इत्यादिषु संयोजितयन्त्रे बैटरी न्यूना भवति"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:920
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Power source connected"
msgstr "विद्युत् स्रोतः सम्बद्धः"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:970
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "The power source has been connected"
msgstr "शक्तिस्रोतः संयोजितः अस्ति"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:1026
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Power source disconnected"
msgstr "विद्युत् स्रोतः विच्छिन्नः"

#: powerdevil.notifyrc:1076
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "The power source has been disconnected"
msgstr "विद्युत्स्रोतः विच्छिन्नः अस्ति"
